:: Great Hawk Gifts List
<<effects>>
<<npc "Great Hawk">>

거대 매에게 무엇을 주시겠습니까?
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[선물 주기 (0:05)|Great Hawk Gifts]]>><<pass 5>><<give_gift "Great Hawk">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
